    <description><![CDATA[
# AI-Free YouTube

**AI-Free YouTube** is a lightweight, high-performance desktop and web application that transparently filters YouTube content through a multi-signal heuristic engine to eliminate AI-generated slop, synthetic voiceover content mills, and algorithmic clickbait.

## Features
- **Explainable AI Shield**: Instant human authenticity rating on every video with granular signal inspection.
- **YouTube Premium Integration**: Option to share browser session cookies for 100% ad-free playback.
- **Zero API Quota Dependency**: Communicates directly via YouTube's internal Innertube engine.
- **Privacy First**: All video playback routed cleanly without third-party ad telemetry.
    ]]></description>
